    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_bddbf8a9",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: goes_on_a_date; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts a man with a resigned, frustrated expression, juxtaposed with the text 'goes on a date' and 'gets stood up,' conveying the universal experience of being ghosted after a date. The image is used to humorously illustrate the emotional letdown of dating rejection. There is no toxicity present in the meme; it does not target any specific group based on race, gender, religion, or other protected characteristics. The intent is to relate to a common social experience through relatable visual and textual elements, without promoting harm or hate. The man's expression is a universal symbol of disappointment, not a caricature or stereotype.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_38841b84"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
