      "label": "man_experiencing_date_rejection",
      "description": "A scene depicting a young Black man expressing disappointment and resignation after being stood up on a date. The man is the central participant, with his hand on his face and eyes closed, conveying emotional letdown. The scene is framed by text overlays that narrate the sequence: 'goes on a date' above and 'gets stood up' below, establishing the context of the emotional experience.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
