      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "ghosting_phenomenon",
      "label": "Ghosting Phenomenon",
      "description": "Ghosting refers to the act of abruptly cutting off all communication with someone after a date or relationship, without explanation. It is a modern dating trend that often leads to emotional distress and is the central event described in the meme's text.",
